es each month, you\u2019ll always have somewhere new lose yourself in. \n\nWORLD CLASS COACHING\n-------------------------\nLet our guides take you on running, hiking and cycling adventures. Whether you are training for a marathon, endeavoring to lead your peloton, or just keeping a healthy lifestyle, our coaches will keep you moving. \n\nANYWHERE. ANYTIME.\n-------------------------\nZero setup and works on any bike, elliptical, treadmill, rowing machine, stepper, erg or other cardio machine. No special hardware required. All tours can be downloaded for offline use. ", "short_description": "Run, cycle or row the world from any treadmill, bike, trainer, elliptical or erg"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bitgym.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.bitgym.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "Active Theory, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://support.bitgym.com/hc/en-us", "website_url": "https://www.bitgym.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25886646400948127"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1305782191560412"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1305782191560412"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1770418920, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1305782191560412"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nod